---
description: Rules for editing runtime prompts and eval datasets
globs: ai/prompts/**, evals/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- A prompt change must bump `version` and be followed by `make evals`; paste
  the metric delta into the commit message.
- Keep `max_output_tokens` as small as the schema allows. Justify increases.
- Golden cases in `evals/datasets/` are human-reviewed. Agents may propose new
  cases into `evals/datasets/proposed/` only; a human promotes them.
- Overrides recorded in production become proposed eval cases via
  `scripts/overrides_to_evals.py`.
